                               private names

  Tailscale lets you open each App with its own private HTTPS name from your
  phone, laptop or TV, wherever you are. Existing IP:port Addresses and
  firewall rules stay unchanged.

  What is Tailscale?
  A service that joins your own devices into one private network, wherever
  they are. Access to Tailscale Addresses follows your Tailscale access rules.
  Existing IP:port Addresses are separate.

